sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Authorized contributor
    participant API as Tenant API
    participant DB as Tenant database
    participant W as Ingestion worker
    participant O as Private object storage
    participant T as Transcription or extraction adapter
    U->>API: Submit notes or authorized asset with provenance and rights
    API->>DB: Commit source metadata and ingestion outbox atomically
    DB-->>API: Source and operation IDs
    API-->>U: Accepted with operation status URL
    W->>DB: Deduplicate job under local tenant context
    W->>O: Fetch tenant-bound quarantined asset
    W->>W: Validate type size and source URL policy
    W->>T: Extract or transcribe minimized authorized source
    T-->>W: Candidate transcript and confidence metadata
    W->>DB: Store immutable source version and provenance
    W-->>U: Notify contributor that source review is required
    Note over U,DB: Source correction never silently mutates an approved plan
